rehearsal with PS5LM_SERVER_HOOKS) only: GET /ps5lm/stats (performance counters and tuning
knobs), POST /ps5lm/knobs (set knobs, each checked by the title), and the prompt chunk a step
of update_slots() fills, at most the context's n_batch (docs/PORTING.md "Performance").

